  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>Given quadratic equation is <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>p</mi><mi>&#160;</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>q</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mi>r</mi></mfrac></math>.</p><p>Let <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>&#945;</mi></math>&nbsp;and&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>&#946;</mi></math>&nbsp;be the&nbsp;roots of given equation.</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mfenced><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>p</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>q</mi></mrow></mfenced><mi>r</mi><mo>=</mo><mfenced><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>p</mi></mrow></mfenced><mfenced><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>q</mi></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>p</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>q</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>r</mi></mrow></mfenced><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>p</mi><mi>q</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>p</mi><mi>r</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>q</mi><mi>r</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p>Now, sum of roots <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mrow><mi>&#945;</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>&#946;</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mo>-</mo><mi>b</mi></mrow><mi>a</mi></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>p</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>q</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>r</mi></mrow></mfenced></math><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mo>-</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>p</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>q</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>r</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math>&nbsp; &nbsp; (<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8757;</mo></math>Given that roots are equal in magnitude and opposite in sign)</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>p</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>q</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>r</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mfenced><mn>1</mn></mfenced></math></p><p>Product of roots <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mrow><mi>&#945;</mi><mi>&#946;</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mi>c</mi><mi>a</mi></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mi>p</mi><mi>q</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>p</mi><mi>r</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>q</mi><mi>r</mi></math></p><p>Now,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>&#945;</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>&#946;</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><msup><mfenced><mrow><mi>&#945;</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>&#946;</mi></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>&#945;</mi><mi>&#946;</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>p</mi><mi>q</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>p</mi><mi>r</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>q</mi><mi>r</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>p</mi><mi>q</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>r</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>p</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>q</mi></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>p</mi><mi>q</mi><mo>+</mo><msup><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>p</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>q</mi></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>p</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>q</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></math>&nbsp; &nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>(</mo></math><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8757;</mo></math>&nbsp;from <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mn>1</mn></mfenced></math><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>)</mo></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>p</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>q</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></math></p>"
